     A*    SCR99  - RESET SCREEN
     A*----------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R SCR99
     A            SCERR     R        I  3  3REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      DSPATR(ND)
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
